    "project_purpose": "Zeebu is a blockchain-based B2B/neobank settlement platform for telecom carriers that uses the ZBU token as a loyalty and settlement token. The reviewed contract surface includes ZBU token deployments, voting-escrow/token-locking related contracts, Lens periphery contracts, and Launchpad contracts on Ethereum and Base; staking and voting-escrow functionality should be described as associated contract functionality rather than the core project purpose. DefiLlama also currently lists Binance/BSC staking activity for Zeebu, so any Ethereum/Base-only review should explicitly state that Binance/BSC staking is excluded from the covered contract surface.",
